    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nAn exceptional four-bedroom detached residence, 1 Northvale occupies a prime position within the highly regarded Northfields development and presents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a stylish, contemporary family home of considerable quality.\n\nBeautifully presented throughout, this impressive property extends to two floors and has been thoughtfully designed to provide exceptionally well-proportioned and versatile accommodation. The interiors combine elegant finishes with intelligent design solutions, while an abundance of natural light and a strong connection between the living accommodation and rear garden further enhance the appeal.\n\nAt the heart of the home is a superb open-plan kitchen and living space, centred around an impressive three-metre island and complemented by extensive floor-to-ceiling cabinetry. The kitchen is exceptionally well equipped, incorporating integrated ovens and microwave, a dedicated coffee station, two fully integrated dishwashers and a premium Quooker instant boiling water tap. A separate utility room provides additional practical storage and workspace.\n\nOne of the property's most distinctive features is the high-specification acoustic sliding wall system, which allows the living room, playroom and kitchen to be opened up or separated according to the needs of the occupants. This provides excellent flexibility for modern family living, from quieter day-to-day use through to larger-scale entertaining.\n\nThe quality of finish continues throughout the accommodation, with premium Porcelanosa sanitaryware, brassware and fittings featured in all three bathrooms. Porcelanosa wood flooring extends throughout the first-floor bedrooms and landing, while the ground floor benefits from high-quality wood-effect tiling, creating a sense of continuity and cohesion throughout the home.\n\nThe principal bedroom is particularly impressive, incorporating a generous bespoke walk-in wardrobe and a luxurious en-suite with dual rain showers and premium Porcelanosa finishes.\n\nThe rear of the property enjoys a highly desirable south-facing aspect, with extensive floor-to-ceiling sliding doors drawing natural light deep into the principal living areas and providing a seamless connection to the garden and terrace. The external terrace is finished with matching Porcelanosa non-slip tiles, creating an attractive continuation of the internal living space.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a generous, high-quality paved driveway providing ample off-street parking, together with a private rear garden. The property also benefits from solar panels, enhancing its energy efficiency and contributing to reduced household energy requirements. An EV charging point has also been installed, providing an excellent future-ready feature for electric vehicle ownership.\n\nFurther practical features include cleverly integrated understairs storage and a home-office area, providing an ideal workspace without compromising on the principal accommodation.\n\nWith its exceptional level of finish, contemporary design, highly versatile living accommodation and excellent energy-efficient features, 1 Northvale represents a particularly impressive modern family home in one of Clonmel's sought-after residential locations."
      },
