        "Content": "<ul><li>Contemporary, architecturally designed accommodation</li><li>Impressive three-metre kitchen island with extensive bespoke storage</li><li>Premium integrated kitchen appliances including two dishwashers and Quooker tap</li><li>Flexible living accommodation with high-specification acoustic sliding wall system</li><li>Luxurious Porcelanosa-appointed bathrooms</li><li>Generous principal bedroom with bespoke walk-in wardrobe and luxury en-suite</li><li>South-facing rear garden providing excellent natural light</li><li>Floor-to-ceiling sliding doors creating a seamless connection between kitchen and garden</li><li>Porcelanosa flooring and finishes throughout</li><li>Private rear garden with matching Porcelanosa tiled terrace</li><li>Solar panels contributing to the property's excellent energy efficiency</li><li>Pre-installed EV charging point</li><li>Turn-key condition throughout</li><li>Excellent modern family accommodation with exceptional attention to detail</ul>"
